    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Package the pr-helper entrypoint script: virt-operator runs the
pr-helper container with /entrypoint.sh, which symlinks the
multipath socket and execs qemu-pr-helper. Only multipath.conf was
installed, so enabling the PersistentReservation feature gate
crashlooped every virt-handler pod.</comment>
    <requestid>1373648</requestid>
